ive, coupled with Li Zhi Cheng's wits and methods, they bring Ai Da's business to new heights together. ~~ Adapted from the novel \"Our Glamorous Times\" by Ding Mo.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.1}],"value":8.1,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":6581,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}